infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title The supervisor signal vocabulary
  desc Four signals, four contracts — miss one and you cannot be stopped or reloaded cleanly
  lists
    - label SIGTERM — graceful stop
      desc Stop accepting, drain in-flight, exit 0 inside the supervisor deadline
    - label SIGINT — interactive stop
      desc Ctrl-C to the foreground group; handle it identically to SIGTERM
    - label SIGHUP — reload config
      desc Re-read, validate, atomically swap; keep the old config on a bad file
    - label SIGKILL / SIGSTOP — not yours
      desc Uncatchable by design; SIGKILL is why the SIGTERM drain has a deadline
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
